controlled: the four linear controlled sources (vcvs, vccs, cccs, ccvs) at an operating point
load "spice/resistor.osdi"
model vsource vsource
model resistor sp_resistor
model vcvs vcvs
model vccs vccs
model cccs cccs
model ccvs ccvs
v1 (in 0) vsource dc=1.0
r1 (in 0) resistor r=1k
e1 (e 0 in 0) vcvs gain=2.0
re (e 0) resistor r=1k
g1 (0 g in 0) vccs gain=1m
rg (g 0) resistor r=1k
vsense (in s) vsource dc=0.0
rs (s 0) resistor r=1k
f1 (0 f) cccs ctlinst="vsense" gain=3.0
rf (f 0) resistor r=1k
h1 (h 0) ccvs ctlinst="vsense" gain=500.0
rh (h 0) resistor r=1k
control
  analysis op1 op
endc
